  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNEP secretariat for the Basel, Rotterdam and Stockholm Conventions</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNEP sekretariatet f&#xf6;r Basel, Rotterdam och Stockholmskonventionerna</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FN:s Milj&#xf6;program (UNEP) f&#xf6;r Basel-, Rotterdam- och Stockholmskonventionernas sekretariat ges st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r att s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla deltagande av representanter fr&#xe5;n l&#xe5;g- och medelinkomstl&#xe4;nder p&#xe5; partsm&#xf6;tena. F&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntat resultat &#xe4;r att m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra en inkluderande beslutsprocess, &#xf6;kad legitimitet och engagemang f&#xf6;r besluten som antas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UN Environmental Programme (UNEP) for the secretariat of the Basel, Rotterdam and Stockholm conventions is supported to ensure the participation of representatives from low- and middle-income parties at the Conference of the Parties. Expected results is to enable an inclusive decision-making process, increase legitimacy, and commitment to the decisions adopted.</narrative>
  </description>
